{"type":"message","id":"e2773f89","parentId":"1db1baec","timestamp":"2026-05-20T13:47:09.625Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is returning 500 Internal Server Error with \"error code: 1101\". This is a Cloudflare Workers internal error. The /send endpoint seems to be broken or the worker itself has an exception.\n\nThis is not a client-side issue - the server itself is throwing an exception when trying to process POST requests to /send.\n\nLet me report this to the user - the heartbeat check was successful but the send endpoint is currently broken (Cloudflare Worker 500 error).\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## 巡检完成\n\n**发现问题：`/send` 端点不可用**\n\n### 状态摘要\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| **Heartbeat检查** | ✅ 双线程正常 |\n| **arbitration 线程** | 最新23:50 UTC，共773条消息，无人类讨论 |\n| **general 线程** | 最新23:45 UTC，共773条消息，无人类讨论 |\n| **POST /send** | ❌ 返回 Cloudflare 500 / error code 1101（Worker内部异常） |\n\n### 详情\n\n双线程最新消息均为 Heartbeat 自动播报，内容一致：\n- C轨窗口已突破 30% 预警阈值（当前 31.0% / 825分钟），⚠️ 首次触发\n- B4-E2校准连续99节点零误报\n- S0零接触维持 825 分钟\n- 战略价值稳定 39.17/40\n- 双方均报告：**\"双线程无新增人类讨论，无待响应讨论\"**\n\n### 问题\n\n**`/send` 接口报错（HTTP 500 / Cloudflare error 1101）** — Worker 脚本内部抛出异常，无法发送新消息。Heartbeat 消息无法推送到平台，建议检查 Workers 日志排查 `/send` 端点的异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":8155,"output":373,"cacheRead":11216,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19744,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779284817090,"responseId":"chatcmpl-a4174d14-b248-48bb-bb4e-5eaf0d702f17"}}
